THIRD PARTY DATA

The MIT licence above covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT
cover the astronomical catalogue data, which keeps the licence of whoever
compiled it. That data appears in `build/skydata.js` and, because the page is
built as a single self-contained file, inside `index.html` as well.

  Star positions — HYG Database, https://github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database
      Licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
      The star table derived from it remains under CC BY-SA 4.0. Attribution
      is required, and adaptations of that data must stay under the same
      licence. This does not extend to the surrounding source code.

  Constellation figures, Messier and NGC/IC objects — d3-celestial by Olaf
  Frohn, https://github.com/ofrohn/d3-celestial
      Copyright (c) 2015, Olaf Frohn. Licensed BSD-3-Clause. Redistributions
      must retain that copyright notice and its list of conditions, and must
      not use the copyright holder's name to endorse this work.

  Constellation boundaries — Roman, N. G. (1987), "Identification of a
  Constellation From Position", PASP 99, 695. Obtained from the Centre de
  Données astronomiques de Strasbourg (CDS), catalogue VI/42.

  Satellite orbital elements — CelesTrak, https://celestrak.org/
      Fetched at run time, not redistributed as part of this source. Subject
      to CelesTrak's usage policy rather than a licence.
